<p style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#55726a;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase">Account security</p>
<h1 style="margin:0;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:32px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.1">Reset your password</h1>
<p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.65">Hi <%= @user.display_name %>,</p>
<p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.65">Use the secure link below to choose a new SceneFoundry password. The link expires in 30 minutes and can be used once.</p>
<p style="margin:28px 0"><a href="<%= @reset_url %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:10px;background:#173d34;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700">Choose a new password</a></p>
<p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#6a7c77">If you did not request this, you can ignore this email. Your current password will keep working.</p>
